<title>SINGAPORE: Lum Chang tenders S$139 million for site.</title>
<headline>Lum Chang tenders S$139 million for site.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lum Chang Holdings Ltd, Singapore Bus Service Ltd and Comfort Group have submitted the top bid of Singapore $139 million for a Singapore property site.  </p>
<p>The bid was for a residential site in the western part of Singapore, in Jurong West, said a Housing Development Board statement.</p>
<p>Another site in the northern part of the island, in Woodlands, drew a top bid of S$196.89 million from Pidemco Land Ltd.</p>
<p>Both sites are slated for development of top-end public housing.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
